<section class="grading-bottom"><article class="ui-card rubric-panel"><div class="section-heading"><span class="icon-tile solid small"><?= uiIcon('rubric',20) ?></span><div><h2>Panduan Rubrik Penilaian Cepat</h2><p>Standar bobot penilaian Kurikulum Merdeka Terintegrasi</p></div><button class="quiet-link" type="button" data-dialog-open="rubric-editor">Ubah Rubrik <?= uiIcon('external',15) ?></button></div><div class="rubric-grid"><?php foreach([['Kerapian Langkah','30%','Penulisan rumus dasar, diagram sketsa vektor, dan urutan pengerjaan matematis.'],['Ketepatan Hasil','50%','Akurasi komputasi matriks determinan, invers, dan hasil akhir perhitungan numerik.'],['Analisis & Catatan','20%','Interpretasi fisis makna hasil vektor terhadap sistem koordinat kartesius 3D.']] as [$title,$weight,$description]): ?><div data-rubric-item><b><span data-rubric-title><?= $title ?></span><span data-rubric-weight><?= $weight ?></span></b><p data-rubric-description><?= $description ?></p></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><p class="rubric-tip"><?= uiIcon('bulb',17) ?> Tips: Anda dapat menekan tombol <kbd>Tab</kbd> di papan ketik untuk beralih siswa secara cepat pada layar koreksi formulir.</p></article><article class="report-sync"><span class="icon-tile glass"><?= uiIcon('sync-report',25) ?></span><h2>Sinkronisasi Rapor Instan</h2><p>Semua nilai yang Anda setujui akan langsung tercatat di Buku Penilaian Digital Wali Kelas dan Portal Peserta Didik.</p><small>Status Sinkronisasi Terakhir <span>Otomatis (Aktif)</span></small><a class="ui-button white full small" href="ekspor.php?type=nilai">Periksa Riwayat Rekapitulasi</a></article></section>
</main><dialog class="portal-dialog" id="rubric-editor" aria-labelledby="rubric-editor-title"><button type="button" data-dialog-close aria-label="Tutup"><?= uiIcon('close') ?></button><h2 id="rubric-editor-title">Panduan Rubrik Penilaian</h2><p>Atur bobot panduan saat meninjau jawaban siswa. Total bobot harus 100%.</p><form class="ui-form" id="rubric-form"><?php foreach(['Kerapian Langkah','Ketepatan Hasil','Analisis & Catatan'] as $index=>$label): ?><label><?= $label ?><input type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" data-rubric-input required aria-label="Bobot <?= $label ?>"></label><?php endforeach; ?><p id="rubric-error" role="alert"></p><button class="ui-button primary">Simpan Rubrik</button></form></dialog>
<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{
 const key='edulms-rubric-<?= (int)$user_id ?>',items=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-rubric-item]')],inputs=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-rubric-input]')];
 function apply(weights){weights.forEach((weight,index)=>{items[index].querySelector('[data-rubric-weight]').textContent=weight+'%';inputs[index].value=weight;});}
 let weights=[30,50,20];try{const stored=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key));if(Array.isArray(stored)&&stored.length===3&&stored.every(n=>Number.isInteger(n)&&n>=0&&n<=100)&&stored.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)===100)weights=stored;}catch{}
 apply(weights);document.querySelector('#rubric-form').addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const next=inputs.map(input=>Number(input.value));if(next.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)!==100){document.querySelector('#rubric-error').textContent='Total bobot harus 100%.';return;}apply(next);try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(next));}catch{}document.querySelector('#rubric-error').textContent='';document.querySelector('#rubric-editor').close();});
});
</script>
